     "Ajungmir near the Pibor mouth: 10 km disc at the Pibor–Baro/Sobat confluence 33.208E 8.438N": "STATED place (p.108); Ajungmir not located, position EDITORIAL",
     "east: cut at the present Sudan/South Sudan–Ethiopia line (Natural Earth 10m admin-0)": "EDITORIAL; pages say 'into Abyssinia' but give no limit there, so the Abyssinian part is NOT drawn",
     "Gila (Gilo) banks": "NOT DRAWN: stated on p.108 but no traced river line was available (Wikidata Q4784098 is a point only)"
